{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10105060","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10105060","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1010506001:0":{"text":"ぺ……ペギー！？","source_cn":"佩……佩吉？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x633AAC70CF20CD8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1010506002:2":{"text":"ちょっと、フィアンセを前にしてその態度はなんなの？","source_cn":"呵，这就是你见到未婚妻的态度吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13A1D983DCA6E6DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1010506003:0":{"text":"あんたが私を避けるから、追いかけてる途中に指輪を東の砂浜に落としちゃったじゃない！","source_cn":"你不肯见我，一路躲来躲去。为了追上你，我的戒指都掉在了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73B154466D28D855","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1010506004:2":{"text":"そこのデカ物二人！何ボーッとしてんのよ！早く探しにいってちょうだい！","source_cn":"你们这俩大个子，愣着干什么？还不快去帮我找！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43CE3AB0281F215E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1010506005:0":{"text":"はあ！？何で俺たちが！？","source_cn":"我们？！我们凭什么要听你的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CC6428AA8BD5E3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1010506006:0":{"text":"貴様！ペギー姫に無礼だぞ！","source_cn":"不得对佩吉公主无礼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x901E89E49B7D389A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1010506007:0":{"text":"姫……？","source_cn":"公主……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31E39446B890AAC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1010506008:0":{"text":"今、何でって聞いたわね？","source_cn":"你刚刚不是问，为什么要听我的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DBEADEA148C582A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1010506009:0":{"text":"今日の私は気分がいいの。だから指輪を見つけた人には、褒美にその指輪をあげるわ。","source_cn":"因为本公主今天心情很好，如果有人找到那枚戒指，我就会把...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84A022E19511E91B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1010506010:0":{"text":"ルビーがはめ込まれた指輪よ。フランツの屋敷を買ってもおつりが来るような値打ちのね。","source_cn":"戒指上可镶嵌着红宝石呢，即便用它买下弗朗茨的宅邸都绰绰有余。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02903E4EECF03480","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1010506011:0":{"text":"うおお！どこだ！？指輪は俺のものだ！！","source_cn":"在哪！戒指在哪！是我的了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AE7F1302FA5296F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1010506012:0":{"text":"もう大丈夫よロワン。あんたのお友達たちはもう中に入ったわ。","source_cn":"罗万，没事啦。你那几个朋友已经溜进去了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F3B4FF3BB3335F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1010506013:0":{"text":"あはは、久しぶりね。ブラドック一世もこんなに大きくなったのね！","source_cn":"哈哈，好久不见啊。布拉达克一世都长得这么大了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE4D32BFBD79B5C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1010506014:0":{"text":"ガァーー！","source_cn":"嘎——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95DC2784F502DBD3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1010506015:0":{"text":"ペギー……ど、どうしてここに？","source_cn":"佩吉，你怎么……会在这里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x364DDD41425C27BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1010506016:0":{"text":"あんたに会うために決まってるでしょ？フランツ荘園の宴に参加してるって、聖石町のミスリル商会の人に教えてもらったの。","source_cn":"当然是为了见你。我去了圣石镇，秘银商会的人和我说，你来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x979A4CB59844398E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1010506017:0":{"text":"ここは危ないわ。あんたにとっては特にね。","source_cn":"这地方很危险，尤其是对你而言。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8D1469D487CAEEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1010506018:0":{"text":"ミスリル商会のお坊ちゃん、一部の人たちの間じゃ、あんたはキラキラ光る目の上のこぶみたいなものなのよ。","source_cn":"别忘了，你可是秘银商会的少爷，在这些人看来，你是一枚亮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD72BA31047F119EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1010506019:0":{"text":"……目の上のこぶ？","source_cn":"……眼中钉？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x282225B398B4D19F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1010506020:0":{"text":"ずっと旅してたあんたじゃ、色々知らないことがあるのよ。","source_cn":"你最近一直在外游历，很多事都不知道吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B55005BB2AFAF2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1010506021:0":{"text":"現に、あの屋敷の主人も……この陰謀の一端を担ってるんだから。","source_cn":"暂且不说太远，在你眼前——这座庄园的主人……便是是这场...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C6378CD6D6D66FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:罗万":{"te